  "total ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧",
  "average ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧",
  "spread ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧",
  "median ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧",
  "modes ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧",
  "variance ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧",
  "svariance ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧",
  "quantile 7/8 ⟦Fraction⟨-4, 3⟩, Fraction⟨11, 2⟩, Fraction⟨-6, 1⟩, Fraction⟨-9, 1⟩, Fraction⟨1, 1⟩⟧"]
failedlabels in List(String) := filter((w in String |-> not isnil(w)), zipwith((ok in Bool |-> (name in String |-> if(ok, "", name))), checkvalues, checklabels))
main in String := if(isnil(failedlabels), "PASS 150", "FAIL " ++ unwords(failedlabels))
